le bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Varied and unpredictable enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro-futuristic visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Accessible yet demanding gameplay</strong>: Can you survive Hard and Nightmare modes?</p></li></ul>","developers":["H\u00e9misph\u00e8re gauche"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3666520","name":"Storm Mined"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767900/d3dea9e2a0aed2c384d8c5f1653c0bef06ba35fc/header.jpg?t=1748354267","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux Arch / Steam Deck SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-5300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 900 1Go<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Don't forget to check controller settings if you use a SteamDeck</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144710,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144710/movie480.mp4?t=1748349757","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144710/movie_max.mp4?t=1748349757"},"name":"coming soon trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144710/20bf9d47887a43fa200f5988d718edae78f49c98/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748349757","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144710/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748349757","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144710/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748349757"}}],"name":"Storm Mined Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-5300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>